hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"387","'Abdullah said"
"388","Ibn 'Umar reported that the Prophet"
"389","Abu Musa reported that the Prophet"
"390","'Abdullah said"
"391","Abu'd-Darda' reported that the Prophet"
"392","""Fear Allah and put things right between\nyou"
"393","Sufyan ibn Usayd al-Hadrami reported that he heard the Prophet"
"394","Ibn 'Abbas reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"395","wailing and attacking a person's lineage."""""""""
"396","A woman called Fusayla said that she heard her father say"
"397","""By Allah I will not ever accept the intercession of anyone for him"
"398","Anas ibn Malik reported that the Messenger of Allah"
